HEAD='<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>80s 펑크 R&B 리스닝</title><style>@font-face{font-family:P;src:url(../../templates/fonts/Pretendard-Light.woff2);font-weight:300}\n@font-face{font-family:P;src:url(../../templates/fonts/Pretendard-Regular.woff2);font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:P;src:url(../../templates/fonts/Pretendard-Medium.woff2);font-weight:500}\n@font-face{font-family:P;src:url(../../templates/fonts/Pretendard-Bold.woff2);font-weight:700}\n@font-face{font-family:S;src:url(../../templates/fonts/dm-serif-display-latin-400-normal.woff2)}*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\n:root{--iv:#F1EDE4;--bk:#111;--g:#8A8A8A;--b:#55524D;--bt:#F1E8CB;--mono:"IBM Plex Mono","DejaVu Sans Mono",monospace}\n.s{width:1080px;height:1350px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:var(--iv);color:var(--bk);font-family:P,sans-serif;margin-bottom:40px}\n.s.dark{background:var(--bk);color:var(--iv)}\n.hd{position:absolute;left:96px;right:96px;top:72px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:21px;letter-spacing:3px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1.5px solid currentColor}\n.ft{position:absolute;left:96px;right:96px;bottom:60px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:20px;letter-spacing:2px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1.5px solid currentColor}\n.ft span:first-child{font-family:P,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px}\n.k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:20px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--g);text-transform:uppercase}\n.h{font-size:76px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-3.5px;line-height:1.2}\n.h em{font-style:normal;font-weight:300}\n.p{font-size:30px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--b);letter-spacing:-.6px}.p b{color:var(--bk)}\n.dark .p{color:#C9C4BB}.dark .p b{color:var(--iv)}\n.al{position:absolute;left:96px;right:96px;display:flex;gap:44px;padding-top:34px;border-top:1.5px solid var(--bk)}\n.al .n{font-family:S,serif;font-size:56px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:14px}\n.al .ar{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:19px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:var(--g);text-transform:uppercase}\n.al .t{font-size:46px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-1.8px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.15}\n.al .t span{font-weight:300;color:var(--g);font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin-left:10px}\n.al .row{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:16px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.5px;color:var(--b)}\n.al .row b{flex:none;width:118px;font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:400;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--g);padding-top:6px}\n.al .tag{margin-top:16px;font-size:20px;color:var(--g)}\n'
A6='<section class="s dark" id="a6"><div class="hd"><span>ENOCH MUSIC ACADEMY</span><span>HOW TO LISTEN</span></div>\n<div class="h" style="position:absolute;left:92px;top:200px">한 곡을,<br><em>세 번 들어 보기</em></div>\n<div style="position:absolute;left:96px;right:96px;top:480px">\n<div style="display:flex;gap:32px;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(241,237,228,.3)"><span style="font-family:S,serif;color:var(--bt);font-size:72px;width:64px;line-height:1">1</span><div><div style="font-size:36px;font-weight:700">처음엔 그냥</div><div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:28px;color:#C9C4BB;line-height:1.5">분석하지 말고 끝까지. 몸이 먼저 반응하는 곳을 기억해 두세요.</div></div></div>\n<div style="display:flex;gap:32px;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(241,237,228,.3)"><span style="font-family:S,serif;color:var(--bt);font-size:72px;width:64px;line-height:1">2</span><div><div style="font-size:36px;font-weight:700">두 번째는 한 악기만</div><div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:28px;color:#C9C4BB;line-height:1.5">베이스만, 혹은 드럼만 따라가 봅니다. 노래도 연주도 여기서 박을 배워요.</div></div></div>\n<div style="display:flex;gap:32px;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(241,237,228,.3);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(241,237,228,.3)"><span style="font-family:S,serif;color:var(--bt);font-size:72px;width:64px;line-height:1">3</span><div><div style="font-size:36px;font-weight:700">세 번째는 따라 하기</div><div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:28px;color:#C9C4BB;line-height:1.5">한 소절만 따라 부르거나 쳐 보고, 녹음해서 원곡과 나란히 들어 보세요.</div></div></div>\n</div><div class="ft"><span>80년대 펑크 · R&amp;B</span><span>06 / 07</span></div></section>'
A7='<section class="s dark" id="a7"><div class="hd"><span>ENOCH MUSIC ACADEMY</span><span>THE ENOCH WAY</span></div>\n<div style="position:absolute;left:92px;top:150px;font-family:\'Helvetica Neue\',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:240px;letter-spacing:-8px;color:#2A2825">ENOCH</div>\n<div class="h" style="position:absolute;left:92px;top:450px">기본은<br><span style="color:var(--bt)">건너뛰지 않습니다.</span></div>\n<div class="p" style="position:absolute;left:96px;right:96px;top:740px">좋은 그루브는 많이 들은 귀에서 나옵니다.<br>옛 레코드를 듣는 것도, 기본의 일부.<br>ENOCH은 모든 과정이 1:1 레슨입니다.</div>\n<div style="position:absolute;left:96px;right:96px;top:1040px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid rgba(241,237,228,.3);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6"><span>에녹실용음악학원 시흥점<br><span style="color:#9A958C">경기도 시흥시 은행로 157 2층</span></span><span style="text-align:right;font-family:var(--mono)">010 3949 3666<br><span style="color:#9A958C;font-family:P,sans-serif;font-size:19px">Vocal · Guitar · Drum · Bass · Piano · MIDI · 작곡</span></span></div>\n<div class="ft"><span>80년대 펑크 · R&amp;B</span><span>07 / 07</span></div></section>'
